  "description": "Vintage City – Distressed Western Grunge Display Font\nBring rugged urban nostalgia, classic western charm, and authentic vintage character to your designs with Vintage City! Inspired by retro city signage, distressed western labels, vintage saloon posters, and rustic varsity lettering, this bold display font features sharp slab serifs, strong outline frames, and heavily weathered grunge textures. As shown in the preview images, it delivers a powerful, adventurous aesthetic that makes your titles, logos, and apparel graphics instantly stand out.\nVintage City is crafted with clean vector paths that carefully preserve its detailed grunge aesthetic while ensuring smooth performance in major design and crafting software, perfect for vinyl cutting, print-on-demand, and sublimation.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vintage City – Distressed Western Grunge Display Font</p>\n<p>Bring rugged urban nostalgia, classic western charm, and authentic vintage character to your designs with Vintage City! Inspired by retro city signage, distressed western labels, vintage saloon posters, and rustic varsity lettering, this bold display font features sharp slab serifs, strong outline frames, and heavily weathered grunge textures. As shown in the preview images, it delivers a powerful, adventurous aesthetic that makes your titles, logos, and apparel graphics instantly stand out.</p>\n<p>Vintage City is crafted with clean vector paths that carefully preserve its detailed grunge aesthetic while ensuring smooth performance in major design and crafting software, perfect for vinyl cutting, print-on-demand, and sublimation.</p>",
